OL,3,GNEWSAAirport owner killed in Swiss Alps
OL,4,Aplane crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn airport owner, businessman and
OL,7,F"incredible dad" from the West Midlands
OL,8,Fhas been named as one of three people
OL,9,Fkilled in a plane crash in the Swiss
OL,10,FAlps last week.
OL,12,FAnthony Hall, known as Tony, owned
OL,13,FWolverhampton Halfpenny Green Airport
OL,14,Fin Staffordshire and was the managing
OL,15,Fdirector of Pegasus, a construction and
OL,16,Frecycling company based in Lye, near
OL,17,FStourbridge.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
